Here's a simple Python script using the Tkinter library to create a custom popup window:

```python
import tkinter as Tk

def show_popup():
    root = Tk.Tk()
    root.title("TSTP DeepSeek Buddy")
    
    label = Tk.Label(root, text="TSTP DeepSeek Buddy", font=('Arial', 18, 'bold'))
    label.pack_configure(fill=Tk.X + Tk.Y, expand=True)
    
    root.mainloop()

show_popup()
```

This script will create a centered popup window with the text "TSTP DeepSeek Buddy". The window will automatically stay on top of other windows.
