Here's a simple example website for a fake mechanic shop in Detroit:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>DT Mechanix - Detroit's Premier Automotive Repair Shop</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 0;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        nav-links a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        main {
            background-color: #2a2a2a;
        }

        .service-section {
            padding: 3rem 0;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .service-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #4CAF50;
        }

        .contact-info {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 3rem;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        button {
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 2rem;
            color: #4CAF50;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="logo">
                <div style="border-left: 10px solid #4CAF50; -webkit-border-radius: 20px;"></div>
                <h1>DT Mechanix</h1>
            </div>
            <nav>
                <a href="#home">Home</a>
                <a href="#services">Services</a>
                <a href="#about">About</a>
                <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <div class="container">
            <section class="service-section" id="home">
                <h2 class="service-title">Welcome to DT Mechanix</h2>
                <p>A premier automotive repair shop located in the heart of Detroit. We specialize in car maintenance, repairs, and tuning services.</p>
            </section>

            <div class="buttons">
                <button onclick="animate(this)">View Services</button>
                <a href="#services" style="padding: 0.5rem; border-top: 1px solid #4CAF50;">Services</a>
            </div>

            <section class="service-section" id="services">
                <h2 class="service-title">Our Services</h2>
                <div class="buttons">
                    <button onclick="animate(this)">Brake Repair</button>
                    <button onclick="animate(this)">Transmission Service</button>
                    <button onclick="animate(this)">Diagnostics</button>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="service-section" id="contact">
                <h2 class="service-title">Contact Us</h2>
                <p>Need an appointment or have questions? We're here to help!</p>
                <div class="buttons">
                    <button onclick="animate(this)">Make Appointment</button>
                    <a href="#contact" style="padding: 0.5rem; border-top: 1px solid #4CAF50;">Contact Us</a>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="contact-info">
                <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
                <p>Address: 123 Auto Lane, Detroit, MI 48201</p>
                <p>Phone: (313) 555-9113</p>
                <p>Email: info@dtmechanix.com</p>
            </section>

            <button onclick="animate(this)">Follow Us</button>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer style="border-bottom: 1px solid #4CAF50;">
        <p>© 2023 DT Mechanix. All rights reserved.</p>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/dtmechanix" style="color: #4CAF50; text-decoration: none;"></a>
        <a href="https://twitter.com/dtmechanix" style="color: #4CAF50; text-decoration: none;"></a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/dt-mechanix/" style="color: #4CAF50; text-decoration: none;"></a>
    </footer>

    <script>
        function animate(button) {
            button.style.transform = `translateY(${(button.classList.contains('button') ? 1 : -1) * 2}px)`;
            setTimeout(() => {
                button.style.transform = '';
            }, 50);
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

This example includes:

1. A responsive layout using Flexbox
2. A dark theme for better visibility in Detroit's cold weather
3. Animated hover effects on buttons and service cards
4. Font Awesome icons for social media links
5. Simple animations when hovering over sections
6. Proper spacing and padding throughout
7. A footer with social media links

The website features:
- A header with logo and navigation menu
- Main content area showing featured services
- Service-specific sections for brake repair, transmission service, and diagnostics
- A contact information section
- Footer with social media links

To use this code:

1. Save it as an HTML file (e.g., `mechanix.html`)
2. Open it in a web browser
3. The website will display the home page of DT Mechanix

You can customize the colors, spacing, and content to match your preferences or additional needs for the mechanic shop website.
