In the CSS, I'll set up flex display for the body to center everything. Each section inside a .shop-content class will have padding and margins for spacing. Borders will be added using border-top on the schedule divs and a simple border style on other elements for consistency.

Testing is important. I'll make sure the site looks good on different screen sizes by setting max-width and using percentages for padding. The animations should be smooth, so I'll use opacity and transform properties.

