However, the model also presents limitations, including being a black box with limited control over outputs, potential biases from pre-existing data leading to hallucinations or misinformation, and scalability challenges as it grows more complex.

Looking ahead, ChatGPT is expected to evolve with improvements in efficiency, accessibility, and integration with emerging technologies like virtual and augmented reality. Efforts toward AI safety and ethical use are anticipated, including better moderation of its outputs to ensure responsible application across industries.
