Here's a simple example website for a fake Detroit mechanic shop:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Detroit Mechanic Shop</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        .nav {
            background-color: #333;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            color: white;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            padding: 80px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* Services Grid */
        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            padding: 80px 0;
        }

        .service-card {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .service-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        /* Testimonials */
        .testimonial {
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e2e2;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* Contact Info */
        .contact-info {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .contact-info div {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="nav">
        <div class="logo">AutoCare Detroit</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#services">Services</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Need Mechanic Service in Detroit?</h1>
        <p>Talk to one of our experienced auto mechanics. We've been serving the Detroit area for years.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Services Grid -->
    <section class="services-grid" id="services">
        <div class="service-card">
            <div class="icon-placeholder"></div>
            <h2>Brake Repairs</h2>
            <p>$150 - $300</p>
            <p>Turbo, discs, fluid change, warning lights</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-card">
            <div class="icon-placeholder"></div>
            <h2>Timing Belts</h2>
            <p>$100 - $250</p>
            <p>Closed Belts, tensioner replacement, timing belt set</p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-card">
            <div class="icon-placeholder"></div>
            <h2>Clutch Service</h2>
            <p>$75 - $150</p>
            <p>Disk, hydraulic, torque specs, fluid change</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Testimonials -->
    <section class="testimonial">
        <p>"Outstanding service and fair prices. Highly recommended!"</p>
        <p>John D.</p>
        <br>
        <p>"Best car shop in Detroit! Professional and knowledgeable."</p>
        <p>Alice S.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact Info -->
    <section class="contact-info">
        <div>
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>Address: 123 Auto Care Rd, Detroit, MI</p>
            <p>Phone: (313) 456-7890</p>
            <p>Email: info@autocaredetroit.com</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2023 AutoCare Detroit. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        // Add any JavaScript functionality here
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
            // Add hover effect to service cards
            const serviceCards = document.querySelectorAll('.service-card');
            serviceCards.forEach(card => {
                card.addEventListener('mouseover', function() {
                    transform: 'translateY(-5px)';
                });
                
                card.addEventListener('mouseout', function() {
                    transform: 'translateY(0)';
                });
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

This example includes:
1. A responsive navigation bar
2. Hero section with a welcoming message
3. Services section with hover effects
4. Testimonials section
5. Contact information
6. Footer

The design uses:
- Basic HTML structure
- CSS Flexbox for layout
- CSS Grid for responsive design
- Built-in shadows and transitions
- Clean, modern styling
- Responsive spacing and padding
- Simple animations on hover states

You can save this as an HTML file and open it in any web browser to see the results. Feel free to customize colors, fonts, and other properties to match your preferences!
